      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T16:10:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t use `anyhow` in `pvmfw`, so returning error msg to caller requires an wrapper type (e.g. `Result\u003c(), String\u003e`) -- but in general Typed .\n\nBTW, I followed the pattern from `fdt.rs` (e.g. `patch_device_tree()`). Do you want refactoring in general?",
      "parentUuid": "a27fdcb3_31b137a9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 57,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 0
